<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ThinkingTime.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE>! I need a little help."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... mmm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s notes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aw, man... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dragged even you kids into this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> scratched his head roughly, looking exasperated.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oof, there we go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> plopped down heavily in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Here, let me have a look."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> snatched </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s notes away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The time of Kikyo-san's death in 735, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the time the suicides started, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and the time the curse-killings started... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cause of death, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> showed no particular surprise as he stared hard at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s notes.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"First, let me teach you kids a way of thinking things through. </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, sit down over there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> opened his eyes wide, suddenly sharp.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"'Kishotenketsu.' You know this one, right? It's the structure you need when you make four-panel comics or stories. [TN: Kishotenketsu: four parts, ki 'setup', sho 'development', ten 'twist', ketsu 'conclusion'.] </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But it's also necessary when you're reasoning something out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Not that I'm much good at deduction myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There's a beginning, then events that follow from it, then the twist that surprises the audience, and finally the wrap-up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I think that's roughly how kishotenketsu goes.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If we think about the curse-killing case with this, which part of kishotenketsu do you think is the most important? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Tell me, one at a time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Which is the most important? It's a simple question, but a pretty hard one.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I apply it to the curse-killing case...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I'd still say the 'conclusion.' 
{PAUSE ""}
What purpose the culprit has in causing these incidents. 
{PAUSE ""}
Figure that out, and the other parts'll come into view too, won't they?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what do you think?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Umm... what do I think..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> rarely struggled over a simple question.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I think it's the 'development.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The 'development' is the present, so if we can solve it, there won't be any more curse-killings, maybe..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s point of view was all about stopping any more curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From that point of view, I could understand what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was saying.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what do you think?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At this point, should I pick the 'setup' or the 'twist'?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then... I'm just going by feel, but the 'setup,' maybe. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">After all, you have to get a firm grasp of the beginning..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> heard the three of us out and smiled slightly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, congratulations! The answer is </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\起承転結.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "38" "3000" "1" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">the 'setup.' That's only true this time, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> took back the notebook </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had snatched and was taking notes as if listening to a lecture.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why is the 'setup' important? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What happens if there's no 'setup'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A state with no 'setup'...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No 'setup'...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What would happen...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It means nothing happens..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right. Without the 'setup,' the case doesn't even exist. Or it hasn't come to light. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And if your understanding of the 'setup' is off, then the 'development, twist and conclusion' after it will all be off too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">True. If the 'setup,' in other words the premise, is off, the story after it turns into a total mess.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, next. What is the 'setup'? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The 'setup' means the start of the case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, can you tell me when the case started?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Obviously, the incident of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s death.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, when the suicides began?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or the curse-killings that began the year after </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I can't... say for sure..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you see what I'm getting at? In this case, the 'setup' is unclear. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Where does the case begin? And is this string of curse-killings really a case at all? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There are people in the settlement who honestly believe it's a curse."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So that was it. We'd rushed to answer and hadn't properly read the actual question.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When the 'setup' is spelled out, like in mystery novels or movies, the story after it is easy to follow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But this time, we have to pin down the 'setup' ourselves.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"By the way, I looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s notes just now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Looks like the idea came up that I might be the culprit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... that's..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, I'm not blaming you. Everyone in this settlement is a suspect. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And the one most likely to be suspected is me, the man who lost </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is a good chance, so let's assume I'm the culprit and try reasoning it out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Go ahead, start. No need to hold back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">That was a pretty bold thing to say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If this makes </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sure that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the culprit, what is he going to do...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then, um... if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is the culprit, the 'setup' is when </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> died, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> listened in silence.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He didn't seem to intend to cut in.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"No, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>, hang on a sec! 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>That means <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> can't tell where the 'setup' is either, let alone who the culprit is, right!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> said that, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> scratched his head with a wry smile.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, of course... If I knew, the culprit would probably be caught already. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I want to know who cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why I want you to assume I'm the culprit and think that part through as well."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, too, was a victim who had lost </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, needed our help.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In that case, the events that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> never came face to face with―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">what happened in Megasawa 10 years ago might hide an important clue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, it's something </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> couldn't possibly know, so it's only natural he's stuck.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But something from 10 years ago like that...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> as the culprit... if we assume that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">a whole lot of things add up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> being right there didn't seem to make her hold back at all.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> jumped off the cliff, but she actually hadn't suffered a fatal injury. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So, since she'd broken the </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, he couldn't forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and he finished her off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But then </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">he himself</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might be suspected of being the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So, calling it a curse, he killed one person every year and made it look as if </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had died from the curse too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s theory certainly added up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had said he had people's respect and trust, so if he used that position...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> murmured that, but said nothing more after it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Had he gone quiet because she'd hit the heart of it, or was he waiting for the next deduction...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"No, but... that's kinda weird. 
{PAUSE ""}
If that's how it is, then <STYLE ID="8">my mom</STYLE> was the cause. If he can't forgive that, then <STYLE ID="8">my mom</STYLE> should've been killed too. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even if not right away, I don't think he'd leave her alone for 10 whole years."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> had a point too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wouldn't open his mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He was just silently waiting for us to speak.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, it felt like he wanted to say something but was deliberately saying nothing.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE>, what do you think? Taking <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE> as the culprit..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> were reasoning from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s motive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe I'll try coming at it from a slightly different angle...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, could I ask you something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sure, go ahead!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The person who first found </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> after she went off somewhere was you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, that's right."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"At that point, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> really dead?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
